   ]
  },
  {
   "text": "Once the first steps of REMOVAL OF SMOKE / FUMES are applied, return to the SMOKE / FUMES / AVNCS SMOKE procedure for the steps for the suspected source while descending to FL 100; reaching FL 100, complete REMOVAL OF SMOKE / FUMES.",
   "applies_to": [
    "all"
   ],
